{"id":470,"name":"leafeon","speciesId":470,"dex":470,"form":"normal","generation":4,"types":["grass"],"stats":{"hp":65,"attack":110,"defense":130,"special-attack":60,"special-defense":65,"speed":95},"abilities":[{"name":"leaf-guard","hidden":false},{"name":"chlorophyll","hidden":true}],"height":10,"weight":255,"baseExp":184,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/470.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/470.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/470.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/470.ogg","genus":"Verdant Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Verdejante","flavor":[{"version":"diamond","text":"Just like a plant, it uses photosynthesis. As a result, it is always enveloped in clear air."},{"version":"platinum","text":"It basically does not fight. With cells similar to those of plants, it can perform photosynthesis."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"When you see LEAFEON asleep in a patch of sunshine, you’ll know it is using photosynthesis to produce clean air."},{"version":"black-2","text":"With cells similar to those of plants, it performs photosynthesis inside its body and creates pure air."},{"version":"x","text":"When you see Leafeon asleep in a patch of sunshine, you’ll know it is using photosynthesis to produce clean air."},{"version":"sun","text":"Its cellular composition is closer to that of a plant than an animal. It uses photosynthesis to produce its energy supply without eating food."},{"version":"moon","text":"The younger they are, the more they smell like fresh grass. With age, their fragrance takes on the odor of fallen leaves."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Although it doesn’t like disputes, it will sharpen the leaf on its tail into a blade and fight if it has to protect its friends."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It gets its nutrition from photosynthesis. It lives a quiet life deep in forests where clean rivers flow."},{"version":"sword","text":"Galarians favor the distinctive aroma that drifts from this Pokémon’s leaves. There’s a popular perfume made using that scent."},{"version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon’s tail is blade sharp, with a fantastic cutting edge that can slice right though large trees."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"Cells similar to those of plants have been found in its fur. Its hard tail can fell a large tree with one stroke, and the tail's sharpness exceeds even that of a sword crafted by a master."}],"flavorPt":"Células semelhantes às das plantas foram encontradas em sua pele. Sua cauda dura pode derrubar uma grande árvore com um só golpe, e a nitidez da cauda excede até mesmo a de uma espada feita por um mestre.","genderRate":1,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["ground"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"eevee","speciesId":133,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Usar Water Stone"],"species":"vaporeon","speciesId":134,"evolvesTo":[]},{"conditions":["Usar Thunder Stone"],"species":"jolteon","speciesId":135,"evolvesTo":[]},{"conditions":["Usar Fire Stone"],"species":"flareon","speciesId":136,"evolvesTo":[]},{"conditions":["Felicidade alta, De dia"],"species":"espeon","speciesId":196,"evolvesTo":[]},{"conditions":["Felicidade alta, À noite"],"species":"umbreon","speciesId":197,"evolvesTo":[]},{"conditions":["Em Eterna Forest","Em Pinwheel Forest","Em Kalos Route 20","Usar Leaf Stone"],"species":"leafeon","speciesId":470,"evolvesTo":[]},{"conditions":["Em Sinnoh Route 217","Em Twist Mountain","Em Frost Cavern","Usar Ice Stone"],"species":"glaceon","speciesId":471,"evolvesTo":[]},{"conditions":["Afeição alta, Sabendo golpe de tipo fairy","Felicidade alta, Sabendo golpe de tipo fairy"],"species":"sylveon","speciesId":700,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":470,"name":"leafeon","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubuser